  m_text: "In a dystopian, cyberpunk future, e-waste has become more than just discarded
    junk, it has come to life. \n\nAs an android named Q, you awake in a dark alleyway
    with no memory of your past, only to discover that the world around you is populated
    by hostile, sentient creatures formed from rogue tech and discarded appliances.
    \n\nFight your way through this broken, chaotic world by battling the Tech Beasts,
    and slowly uncover the mysteries of your forgotten existence.\r\n\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
